      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "...RESPONDENTS  -2-  NC: 2025:KHC:14901  CRL.P No. 4995 of 2025 (BY SRI.LAKSHMAN B, HCGP FOR R.1;\nNOTICE TO R.2 IS D/W V/O/D 07.04.2025)\n CRL.P IS FILED U/SEC.482 CR.PC (FILED U/S 528 BNSS) BY THE ADVOCATE FOR THE PETITIONER PRAYING THAT THIS HONOURABLE COURT MAY BE PLEASED TO QUASH ENTIRE PROCEEDINGS IN C.C.NO.11666/2016, PENDING ON THE FILE OF HONBLE XXIV ACMM COURT, BENGALURU FOR THE OFFENCE P/U/SEC.498A, 504 R/W 34 OF IPC AND SEC 3 AND 4 OF D.P. ACT,\nARISING OUT OF CR.NO.13/2016 AGAINST THIS PETITIONER,\nWHICH REGISTERED BY THE FIRST RESPONDENT - VIJAYANAGARA POLICE STATION, BENGALURU AND ETC.",
