      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "THIS PETITION, COMING ON FOR ADMISSION, THIS DAY,\nORDER WAS MADE THEREIN AS UNDER:\nCORAM: HON'BLE MR JUSTICE HEMANT CHANDANGOUDAR  ORAL ORDER 1.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
