        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "2. The petitioner is the elder brother of accused No.1, and accused Nos.2 and 3 are the father-in-law and mother-in-law of respondent No.2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2054,
      "end": 2193,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "They had approached this Court in W.P. No.24845/2023 challenging the very same impugned proceedings.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2194,
      "end": 2294,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "W.P. No.24845/2023",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 2228,
          "end": 2246
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "This Court, vide order dated 19.04.2024, quashed the proceedings insofar as they relate to the said accused, noting that the parties had amicably resolved their dispute and the de facto complainant had agreed to withdraw all allegations made against them.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2295,
      "end": 2550,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "19.04.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2324,
          "end": 2334
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "Therefore, this petition also deserves to be NC: 2025:KHC:14901 disposed of in terms of the order passed by this Court in W.P. No.24845/2023.\n3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 2551,
      "end": 2695,
      "entities": [
        {
